            <div xml:id="d555">

                <pb facs="0745" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg631"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.51/1545: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hood</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-09-16T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                                1922—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>28. Legation’s 30, September 8, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>In case intimated crisis develops and Bank asks further indorsement of the
                    Liberian pledge of German liquidation funds as security <pb facs="0746" n="632"
                        xml:id="pg632"/> for further advances to Liberian Government, you will
                    promptly cable Bank’s proposal to the Department and await instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
